2026-07-29T01:57:01.5147685Z [36;1mfor i, block in enumerate(blocks[1:], 1):[0m
2026-07-29T01:57:01.5147892Z [36;1m    hm = re.findall(r'dns:(\d+)h/(\d+)m', block)[0m
